I've created a reproducible example below (apologies for it being a bit verbose but so is Tensorflow!). The idea is that I want the images used for training to be pre-processed using pixel standardization, and no-preprocessing done at test time.

The code is not throwing any errors by I know the section below commented in capital letters "THIS IS NOT CORRECT" is not the right way of doing it, as I'm not making use of the already trained network to make predictions. 

Any hint on this would be highly appreciated.

